+"""Client for the internal reports/exports API.
+
+``ApiClient`` is a thin, synchronous wrapper over an injected ``Transport``
+(the host's HTTP stack in production, an in-memory fake in tests). Every call
+is a ``GET``; see README.md for the full integration guide.
+
+Requests
+    URL is ``config.base_url`` (trailing ``/`` stripped) + the endpoint path.
+    Resource IDs are interpolated into the path as-is, without escaping.
+    Query parameters whose value is ``None`` are dropped; the rest are encoded
+    with ``urllib.parse.urlencode`` (spaces become ``+``, ``&`` becomes ``%26``).
+    Every request sends ``Accept: application/json``,
+    ``Authorization: Bearer <config.token>`` and ``User-Agent: <config.user_agent>``.
+
+Dates and times
+    Naive datetimes are treated as UTC. Sub-second precision is truncated.
+    ``list_reports`` sends ``since``/``until`` as America/Bogota local time
+    (fixed UTC-05:00) with no offset, e.g. ``2024-01-01T00:00:00`` UTC is sent as
+    ``2023-12-31T19:00:00``. ``list_exports`` sends ``created_after`` in UTC with
+    a ``Z`` suffix, e.g. ``2024-01-01T00:00:00Z``.
+
+Errors
+    Any final response with status >= 400 raises ``ApiError`` (``status``,
+    ``path`` without the query string, raw ``body``). Transport exceptions and
+    JSON decoding errors are not wrapped and propagate unchanged.
+
+Retries
+    * HTTP 429, every endpoint: resend up to ``config.rate_limit_retries`` times
+      (default 3), sleeping ``Retry-After`` seconds each time (integer seconds
+      only; missing, non-integer or negative values fall back to 1s; the value
+      is not capped).
+    * HTTP 400, ``list_reports`` only (paths in ``FLAKY_ENDPOINTS``): up to
+      ``config.retry_attempts`` total attempts (default 5), sleeping
+      ``retry_backoff_seconds * n`` before retry ``n`` (0.5s, 1.0s, 1.5s, 2.0s).
+      Each attempt runs its own 429 handling, so the two budgets are independent.
+    * Nothing else is retried: not 5xx, not other 4xx, not transport errors.
+"""
 
 from __future__ import annotations
 
